<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $65-3/4 (FIM 321.90).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $65-3/4 (FIM 321.90).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $1-3/8 at $65-3/4 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 321.90 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia A closed up 15.50 at 330.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $0-3/8 at $34-3/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 84.10 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.90 markka at 83.80.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended down $0-1/8 at $19-5/8 in New York on Thursday. The price corresponds to about 96.10 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed up 1.00 markka 96.50 markka. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
